        },
        {
          "text": "ni Zanoa, ni Adullamu, ni mu byalo ebibyezungulwire. Ate abandi baaba mu Lakishi, ni mu masamba agakiriinaine, ni mu Azeka, ni mu byalo ebikyezungulwire. Kale kyaba nti ab'ekika kya Yuda baabanga mu kiketezo ekiri ghagati gha Beerisheba n'ekiiko ky'e Hinnomu.",
          "type": "text",
